OL,3,GNEWSASeveral fallen trees in Essex pose
OL,4,A'risk to life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have been called out to
OL,7,Fseveral fallen trees in Essex which
OL,8,Fthey say posed a "risk to life".
OL,10,FCrews freed a man trapped in his car
OL,11,Fafter a tree fell on it in Burnt Mills
OL,12,FRoad in Pitsea, near Basildon, at about
OL,13,F16:47 BST, a spokesperson said.
OL,15,FHe was left in the care of the
OL,16,Fambulance service.
OL,18,FPictures shared on Facebook also show a
OL,19,Flarge tree collapsed on a car in
OL,20,FHobleythick Lane in Westcliff-on-Sea.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
